{"id":"n54448-1-8","stage":1,"title":"디자인 · 设计","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54448-1-8-1","ko":"어떤 디자인을 찾으세요?","zh":"您在找哪种设计呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디자인을","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾으세요?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/38c756dbdaffbc15adf0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54448-1-8-2","ko":"화려하지 않고 깔끔한 게 좋을 것 같아요.","zh":"我觉得不花哨、简洁的设计会比较好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화려하지","meaning":"华丽","explanation":"화려하다：华丽；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"화려하다","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73229","senseId":"1","lemma":"화려하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깔끔한","meaning":"洁净，利落","explanation":"깔끔하다：洁净，利落；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"깔끔하다","audio":"/audio/f6ed7f4901108f75a819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32552","senseId":"1","lemma":"깔끔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e44483c48cde72bc","term":"화려하다","zh":"华丽","audio":"/audio/e44483c48cde72bc2261.mp3","entryId":"73229","definition":"美丽好看，明亮耀眼，看起来好。","pronunciation":["화려하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"f6ed7f4901108f75","term":"깔끔하다","zh":"洁净，利落","audio":"/audio/f6ed7f4901108f75a819.mp3","entryId":"32552","definition":"外观端正、干净。","pronunciation":["깔끔하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5787c6e85109b9446a55.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.676,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54448","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.1267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您在找哪种设计呢？","我觉得不花哨、简洁的设计会比较好。","听说叫裕敏的那位学生这么聪明吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您在找哪种设计呢？","我觉得不花哨、简洁的设计会比较好。","听说叫裕敏的那位学生这么聪明吗？"],"answer":1}]}
